Fires a beam that turns matter into dust, inflicting [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage and [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical (warp) damage.

Alternatively you may target yourself, creating a field of radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] around you that will inflict the damage over three turns.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
